# 鹈鹕骑自行车2D动画

我将创建一个HTML文件，其中包含一个SVG绘制的鹈鹕骑自行车的2D动画。这个动画将使用CSS和SVG动画来实现。

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>鹈鹕骑自行车动画</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background-color: #f0f8ff;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        
        .container {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 800px;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        
        h1 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
        }
        
        .description {
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        
        .svg-container {
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        svg {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            height: auto;
        }
        
        .controls {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        
        button {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: #3498db;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }
        
        button:hover {
            background-color: #2980b9;
        }
        
        .footer {
            color: #777;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        
        /* 动画效果 */
        .pedal {
            animation: pedal-rotate 2s linear infinite;
            transform-origin: center;
        }
        
        .wheel {
            animation: wheel-rotate 2s linear infinite;
            transform-origin: center;
        }
        
        .pelican-body {
            animation: pelican-bounce 1s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        
        .pelican-leg {
            animation: leg-motion 1s ease-in-out infinite;
            transform-origin: 0 0;
        }
        
        .pelican-head {
            animation: head-bob 2s ease-in-out infinite;
            transform-origin: 0 0;
        }
        
        .cloud {
            animation: cloud-move 15s linear infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes pedal-rotate {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }
        
        @keyframes wheel-rotate {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }
        
        @keyframes pelican-bounce {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-5px); }
        }
        
        @keyframes leg-motion {
            0%, 100% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            25% { transform: rotate(30deg); }
            75% { transform: rotate(-30deg); }
        }
        
        @keyframes head-bob {
            0%, 100% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            50% { transform: rotate(5deg); }
        }
        
        @keyframes cloud-move {
            0% { transform: translateX(-100px); }
            100% { transform: translateX(500px); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>鹈鹕骑自行车动画</h1>
        <p class="description">这是一个纯HTML/SVG创建的2D动画，展示了一只鹈鹕骑自行车的场景。鹈鹕的腿部、车轮和身体都有动画效果。</p>
        
        <div class="svg-container">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 600 400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <!-- 背景天空和云朵 -->
                <rect width="600" height="400" fill="#87CEEB" />
                
                <!-- 云朵 -->
                <g class="cloud">
                    <ellipse cx="100" cy="80" rx="40" ry="20" fill="white" opacity="0.8" />
                    <ellipse cx="130" cy="90" rx="30" ry="15" fill="white" opacity="0.8" />
                    <ellipse cx="80" cy="95" rx="25" ry="10" fill="white" opacity="0.8" />
                </g>
                
                <g class="cloud" style="animation-delay: -5s;">
                    <ellipse cx="400" cy="60" rx="50" ry="25" fill="white" opacity="0.8" />
                    <ellipse cx="440" cy="70" rx="35" ry="18" fill="white" opacity="0.8" />
                    <ellipse cx="360" cy="75" rx="30" ry="15" fill="white" opacity="0.8" />
                </g>
                
                <!-- 地面 -->
                <rect x="0" y="300" width="600" height="100" fill="#7CFC00" />
                <path d="M0 300 Q150 280 300 300 Q450 320 600 300" fill="#7CFC00" />
                
                <!-- 自行车 -->
                <g id="bicycle">
                    <!-- 车架 -->
                    <path d="M200 250 L250 200 L300 250 L250 300 Z" fill="#FF6B6B" stroke="#333" stroke-width="2" />
                    <line x1="250" y1="200" x2="350" y2="220" stroke="#FF6B6B" stroke-width="3" />
                    
                    <!-- 前轮 -->
                    <circle class="wheel" cx="350" cy="300" r="50" fill="#FFF" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3" />
                    <circle cx="350" cy="300" r="40" fill="none" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1" />
                    <circle cx="350" cy="300" r="10" fill="#333" />
                    
                    <!-- 后轮 -->
                    <circle class="wheel" cx="200" cy="300" r="50" fill="#FFF" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3" />
                    <circle cx="200" cy="300" r="40" fill="none" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1" />
                    <circle cx="200" cy="300" r="10" fill="#333" />
                    
                    <!-- 脚踏板 -->
                    <g class="pedal" transform="translate(250, 250)">
                        <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="15" fill="#FFD700" stroke="#333" stroke-width="2" />
                        <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="15" stroke="#333" stroke-width="2" />
                    </g>
                    
                    <!-- 车把 -->
                    <path d="M350 220 L370 180 L350 160" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3" fill="none" />
                    <circle cx="370" cy="180" r="5" fill="#333" />
                </g>
                
                <!-- 鹈鹕 -->
                <g class="pelican-body">
                    <!-- 身体 -->
                    <ellipse cx="250" cy="200" rx="40" ry="30" fill="#FFF" stroke="#333" stroke-width="2" />
                    
                    <!-- 头部 -->
                    <g class="pelican-head" transform="translate(270, 170)">
                        <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="20" fill="#FFF" stroke="#333" stroke-width="2" />
                        <!-- 鹈鹕的喙 -->
                        <path d="M10 0 L30 5 L10 10 Z" fill="#FFA500" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1" />
                        <!-- 眼睛 -->
                        <circle cx="5" cy="-5" r="3" fill="#333" />
                    </g>
                    
                    <!-- 腿部 -->
                    <g class="pelican-leg" transform="translate(250, 250)">
                        <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="30" stroke="#FFA500" stroke-width="4" />
                        <circle cx="0" cy="30" r="5" fill="#FFA500" />
                    </g>
                    
                    <!-- 翅膀 -->
                    <path d="M230 200 Q200 180 230 160 Q260 180 230 200" fill="#FFF" stroke="#333" stroke-width="2" />
                </g>
                
                <!-- 鹈鹕的尾巴 -->
                <path d="M210 200 Q190 210 210 220 Q230 210 210 200" fill="#FFF" stroke="#333" stroke-width="2" />
            </svg>
        </div>
        
        <div class="controls">
            <button id="pause-btn">暂停动画</button>
            <button id="play-btn">播放动画</button>
            <button id="speed-up-btn">加速</button>
            <button id="speed-down-btn">减速</button>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>纯HTML/SVG创建的2D动画 • 鹈鹕骑自行车 • 无外部依赖</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <script>
        // 控制动画的JavaScript
        const pauseBtn = document.getElementById('pause-btn');
        const playBtn = document.getElementById('play-btn');
        const speedUpBtn = document.getElementById('speed-up-btn');
        const speedDownBtn = document.getElementById('speed-down-btn');
        
        // 获取所有动画元素
        const animationElements = document.querySelectorAll('.pedal, .wheel, .pelican-body, .pelican-leg, .pelican-head, .cloud');
        
        // 暂停动画
        pauseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            animationElements.forEach(el => {
                el.style.animationPlayState = 'paused';
            });
        });
        
        // 播放动画
        playBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            animationElements.forEach(el => {
                el.style.animationPlayState = 'running';
            });
        });
        
        // 加速动画
        speedUpBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            animationElements.forEach(el => {
                const currentAnimation = el.style.animation;
                if (currentAnimation) {
                    // 提取当前动画时间
                    const match = currentAnimation.match(/(\d+)s/);
                    if (match) {
                        const currentTime = parseFloat(match[1]);
                        const newTime = currentTime / 1.5;
                        // 重新设置动画
                        el.style.animation = `${el.style.animation.replace(/(\d+)s/, `${newTime}s`))}`;
                    }
                }
            });
        });
        
        // 减速动画
        speedDownBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            animationElements.forEach(el => {
                const currentAnimation = el.style.animation;
                if (currentAnimation) {
                    // 提取当前动画时间
                    const match = currentAnimation.match(/(\d+)s/);
                    if (match) {
                        const currentTime = parseFloat(match[1]);
                        const newTime = currentTime * 1.5;
                        // 重新设置动画
                        el.style.animation = `${el.style.animation.replace(/(\d+)s/, `${newTime}s`))}`;
                    }
                }
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

## 动画说明

这个HTML文件包含了一个完整的鹈鹕骑自行车的2D动画，特点如下：

1. **SVG图形**：
   - 鹈鹕的身体、头部、喙、翅膀和腿部
   - 自行车的车架、车轮、脚踏板和车把
   - 背景天空、云朵和地面

2. **动画效果**：
   - 自行车车轮旋转动画
   - 脚踏板旋转动画
   - 鹈鹕身体上下 bounce 动画
   - 鹈鹕腿部运动动画
   - 鹈鹕头部摆动动画
   - 云朵移动动画

3. **交互控制**：
   - 暂停/播放动画按钮
   - 加速/减速动画按钮

这个动画完全使用HTML、SVG和CSS创建，没有依赖任何外部库或资源。你可以直接复制代码到HTML文件中运行，或者保存为HTML文件并在浏览器中打开。

